        "TypeNamePlural": "ThemeTokenAssignments",
        "DisplayName": "Theme Token Assignment",
        "DisplayNamePlural": "Theme Token Assignments",
        "Description": "A MAP-native intersection holon binding one Theme to one DesignToken and the concrete presentation value supplied for it. The ordered (Theme, DesignToken) pair is its semantic key, making one assignment per token explicit and validating complete Theme coverage. Its value is constrained by a DTCG-aligned DesignTokenType, but this holon and its graph representation do not imply DTCG serialization."
      },
      "relationships": [
        {
